flowchart TD
 Start[📝 Open /posts/create] --> Form[Enter title and TipTap content]
 Form --> Image{Optional image?}
 Image -->|Yes| Client[Client type/size checks and preview]
 Image -->|No| Submit[Choose Save Draft or Publish]
 Client --> Submit
 Submit --> Server[StorePostRequest validation]
 Server --> Valid{Valid request?}
 Valid -->|No| Errors[Return field errors]
 Valid -->|Yes| Publish{Publishing?}
 Publish -->|Yes| Content{Content non-empty?}
 Content -->|No| Errors
 Content -->|Yes| Save[Store image and create post]
 Publish -->|No, draft| Save
 Save --> Redirect[Redirect to dashboard]
 Redirect --> End[Show success state]
 Save -.-> Warning[⚠️ HTML sanitization still required]
